Z||000002||BBBAD GT||08-31-2000||01:50 PM||||Archie:<P>Does that kit work with the E brake?  How similiar is it to the RCC stuff I have? (BTW, all url links I've found for RCC goes to your webpage, and its 'not found', were you a dealer for RCC?)  <P>I do know the 11" kit requires you use at least 16" wheels.  Also, you can toss out the 15" spacesaver tire and carry a can of 'fix-a-flat', because it won't fit over the 11+" brakes.  Oh well.....<P><BR><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/BBBAD_GT_SIG.gif">    <P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/V8Fiero" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD V8</A><P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/Fiero.htm" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD GT</A><P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD 5.0</A>||||reg||1
